        "href": "https://www.fca.org.uk/firms/authorisation/apply"
      },
      {
        "id": "small",
        "label": "FCA: regulatory guide for credit brokers",
        "href": "https://www.fca.org.uk/firms/regulatory-guide-credit-brokers"
      },
      {
        "id": "promotions",
        "label": "FCA: key rules for credit brokers",
        "href": "https://www.fca.org.uk/firms/credit-broking-rules"
      },
      {
        "id": "check",
        "label": "FCA: checking a firm’s authorisation",
        "href": "https://www.fca.org.uk/consumers/how-check-firm-individual-authorised"
      },
      {
        "id": "broker",
        "label": "FCA: applying as a consumer credit broker",
        "href": "https://www.fca.org.uk/firms/authorisation/consumer-credit-brokers"
      }
    ],
    "group": "fca",
    "finance": false,
    "reviewed": "2026-11-01",
    "description": "What an FCA licence means for car dealers, how to check a Firm Reference Number and permissions, and what to do when a Register entry does not match.",
    "seoTitle": "FCA Licence for Car Dealers: Check Permissions | 009 Compliance",
