    "answer": "Start with the firm’s permissions. CCR009 applies to relevant ancillary credit firms with credit broking, debt adjusting, debt counselling or credit information services permissions, subject to the applicable reporting rules. A dealership’s legal status and principal arrangements matter; receiving commission alone is not the test.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Check the authorised firm and its activities",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Match the legal entity and Firm Reference Number (FRN) to the permission record. Then review the actual reporting schedule and the relevant Handbook scope rules. Do not assume that another company in the same group, or a previous owner, has the same reporting position."
