  "/what-information-is-needed-for-ccr009": {
    "title": "What Information Is Needed for CCR009?",
    "answer": "The information needed for CCR009 depends on the firm’s permissions, activities and answers in the form. Use the current data items in the FCA Handbook’s Supervision (SUP) section, Annex 38C with the completion notes in Annex 38D. Build a record of each applicable question, its definition and the evidence supporting your answer.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Map questions to evidence",
        "paragraphs": [
          "The table below is a preparation map, not a replacement for the full return or a claim that every category appears for every firm. Use the exact field wording, reporting period and any specified snapshot date when preparing the answer."
        ],
        "bullets": [],
        "columns": [
          "Question or topic",
          "Records to consult",
          "Check before entering"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Credit broking activities — field 101A",
            "Customer journey, introduction records and partner arrangements.",
            "Select the applicable activity categories; introductions to a lender, hire provider and another broker are distinct."
          ],
          [
            "Business model and permissions",
            "Permission record, business plan and current operating arrangements.",
            "Describe the actual business, including relevant changes."
          ],
          [
            "Marketing questions that appear",
            "Website, advertising channels and approved promotional material.",
            "Use the question’s scope rather than assuming all marketing is identical."
          ],
          [
            "Revenue and remuneration questions that appear",
            "Accounts, transaction records and broker/lender statements.",
            "Apply that field’s definition; vehicle sale value, credit advanced and commission are different figures."
          ],
          [
            "Staff questions that appear",
            "Role descriptions, staffing and training records.",
            "Use the population and date specified by the question."
          ],
          [
            "Principal and AR information, where applicable",
            "Agreed AR data and records of which activity the principal is responsible for.",
            "Follow the consolidation instructions and avoid duplication."
          ]
        ],
        "sources": [
          {
            "id": "form",
            "label": "FCA Handbook: SUP 16 Annex 38C — CCR009 data items",
            "href": "https://handbook.fca.org.uk/handbook/sup16/sup16s152"
          },
          {
            "id": "notes",
            "label": "FCA Handbook: SUP 16 Annex 38D — completion notes",
            "href": "https://handbook.fca.org.uk/handbook/sup16/sup16s153"
          }
        ],
        "links": [],
        "id": "guide-section-1"
      },
      {
        "title": "Create a working data dictionary",
        "paragraphs": [
          "For each applicable field, record its reference, wording, definition, period or date, evidence location, calculation and preparer. Add a reviewer column if another person checks the work. This is a suggested working method, not an extra return to submit.",
          "If a question’s meaning is uncertain, resolve it against the notes or with the FCA before entering a figure. Do not fill the gap with a total that happens to be available."
        ],
        "bullets": [],
        "columns": [
          "Working-record column",
          "What to enter"
