    "answer": "CCR009 and CCR007 are different FCA returns. CCR009 covers relevant ancillary credit firms; CCR007 is Key Data for Credit Firms with Limited Permissions. CCR009 replaces some CCR007 information, but relevant limited-permission firms can still need to submit both. Follow each return’s current instructions and schedule.",
